# Solar Power System Simulator

A thesis-quality full-stack solar power system simulator for design, modeling, and performance evaluation.

## Overview
This application models a photovoltaic (PV) system using engineering assumptions grounded in common standards and best practices including:

- IEC 61724 for photovoltaic system performance monitoring
- IEC 60364 for electrical installations
- NEC-aligned design safety assumptions for general solar system planning
- Typical PV system loss and efficiency factors used in feasibility studies

## Features
- Solar system design parameters for PV capacity, tilt, azimuth, losses, battery, inverter, and load
- Climate and irradiance modeling
- Annual and monthly energy yield estimation
- Capacity factor, performance ratio, specific yield, autonomy, and LCOE calculations
- CO2 avoidance and payback assessment
- Web dashboard with scenario comparison and visual analytics
- Full-stack API-driven architecture

## Tech stack
- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + Recharts
- Backend: Node.js + Express + TypeScript
- Data layer: Prisma + SQLite (ready for extension to PostgreSQL)

## Run locally

### 1. Install dependencies
```bash
npm install
```

### 2. Start backend and frontend
```bash
npm run dev
```

### 3. Access the app
- Frontend: http://localhost:5173
- Backend API: http://localhost:4000/api

## API example
```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/api/simulations/run \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "projectName": "Academic Microgrid",
    "location": {
      "latitude": 6.5244,
      "longitude": 3.3792,
      "altitudeM": 40,
      "ghiKwhM2Day": 5.4
    },
    "system": {
      "pvCapacityKw": 12,
      "panelEfficiency": 0.2,
      "panelAreaM2": 60,
      "tiltDeg": 15,
      "azimuthDeg": 180,
      "temperatureCoeffPerC": 0.004,
      "systemLossesPercent": 14,
      "inverterEfficiency": 0.96,
      "batteryCapacityKwh": 28,
      "maxDepthOfDischarge": 0.8,
      "batteryEfficiency": 0.92,
      "batteryPowerKw": 8
    },
    "load": {
      "dailyLoadKwh": 38,
      "peakLoadKw": 11,
      "loadProfile": [0.35, 0.3, 0.28, 0.32, 0.4, 0.7, 0.95, 1.1, 0.9, 0.7, 0.65, 0.52, 0.6, 0.8, 0.9, 1.0, 1.1, 1.2, 1.0, 0.75, 0.72, 0.66, 0.48, 0.38]
    },
    "economic": {
      "capitalCostUsd": 24500,
      "maintenanceCostUsdPerYear": 300,
      "energyPriceUsdPerKwh": 0.18,
      "discountRate": 0.08,
      "projectLifetimeYears": 20,
      "gridCarbonFactorKgPerKwh": 0.425
    }
  }'
```

